#import "template.typ": contract
#show: contract.with(
  title: "Data Processing Addendum",
  subtitle: "to the Master Services Agreement between Fernway and Quaywise Couriers",
)

Fernway is the controller and Quaywise Couriers ("Courier") is the processor of the personal data described below. Both companies are fictional.

== 1. Scope

Courier processes the names, delivery addresses, phone numbers and delivery notes of Fernway's customers, only to deliver and collect bikes.

== 2. Instructions

Courier processes personal data only on Fernway's documented instructions, including this addendum and the Master Services Agreement.

== 3. Security

3.1 Courier keeps personal data on encrypted devices and limits access to the staff who need it for a Booking.

3.2 Courier tests its security measures at least once a year and shares a summary of the results on request.

#pagebreak()

== 4. Personal data breaches

4.1 Courier will notify Fernway of a personal data breach without undue delay.

4.2 The notice describes the breach, the data and the people affected, and what Courier is doing about it.

== 5. Sub-processors

5.1 Fernway gives general authorisation to the sub-processors listed in Annex 2.

5.2 Courier will inform Fernway of any new sub-processor.

== 6. Deletion

Courier deletes the customer personal data 180 days after the Master Services Agreement ends, unless the law requires it to keep the data longer.

== Annex 2: Sub-processors

To be provided.
